<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle steady to off $1.00--USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle steady to off $1.00--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were steady to $1.00 per cwt lower. Cattle Receipts - 2,475.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 75.00-82.25; 700-800 lbs 74.00-77.00. Holstein Large 2 500-600 lbs 63.00-69.75; 700-800 lbs 55.00-62.00.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 71.00-78.50; 700-800 lbs few 70.50-73.00. Small 1 400-500 lbs few 62.00-70.00. Medium and Large 2 500-600 lbs 70.00-71.00.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
